calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025, October to November finished at 42% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 48% of normal on the middle.</p>"}
